sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant R as Gateway router - platform layer
  participant P as Champion - prod
  participant S as Candidate - shadow
  participant J as Async scorer - Spot pool
  U->>R: Request
  R->>P: 100 percent traffic - user-facing
  P-->>U: Response
  R->>S: Sampled copy - fire and forget
  S-->>J: Candidate response + context
  P-->>J: Champion response + context
  J->>J: Judge both, compare scores, log delta
  J->>J: Feed disagreements into golden-set candidates
